      "date": "2026-04-10T11:28:07.000Z",
      "title": "Now 20% overvalued",
      "body": "The stock has been flat over the last 90 days, currently trading at ₹123. The fair value is estimated to be ₹102, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has grown by 7.8% over the last 3 years. Earnings per share has grown by 12%. For the next 3 years, revenue is forecast to grow by 13% per annum. Earnings are also forecast to grow by 42% per annum over the same time period.",
